    "summary": "After this model shoots in your Shooting phase, pick 1 enemy unit, other than **MONSTERS** and **VEHICLES**, that at least 1 of those attacks hit. Until the phase ends, ranged attacks by friendly **DEATH GUARD** units that target the picked unit improve their Armour Penetration by 1.\n\nThis ability can affect each enemy unit only once per phase.",
